**DIRAC
.TITLE
 calculate selected grid function on a 3D regular grid and export it to an external h5 file
**HAMILTONIAN
.DFT
 B3LYP
**INTEGRALS
*READIN
.UNCONTRACT
**WAVE FUNCTION
.SCF
*SCF
.CLOSED_SHELL
10
.EVCCNV
1.0D-8
**VISUAL
.OUTPRI
.GRIDS 
1
id=1 input=2d
.2D
 0.0  0.0  0.0     !origin
 0.0  0.0  2.0     !"right"
 20                !nr of points origin-"right"
 0.0  2.0  0.0     !"top"
 20                !nr of points origin-"top"
.GRIDFUNCTIONS
1
name=ed id_grid=1 purpose=visualization export=yes file_out=ed_on2Dgrid.h5
*END OF
